				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna</strong> and <strong>Sean Penn</strong> are NOT getting back together, despite a new report. <a href="http://www.gossipcop.com/madonna-back-together-sean-penn-reunite/" target="_blank"><strong>Gossip Cop </strong></a>can exclusively correct this story. They’re told it is not true.</p>
<p>According to the National Enquirer, Madonna’s 14-year-old son <strong>Rocco Ritchie</strong> has persuaded the ex-spouses to reunite following Penn’s recent split with Charlize Theron, and her years-ago split with his dad Guy Ritchie. A so-called “source” tells the supermarket tabloid that Rocco called up Penn within a day of the actor’s breakup with Theron “begging him to ask his mom out.” The magazine’s supposed “insider” further claims, “Sean’s always loved Madonna. He thinks she’s the only woman strong enough to handle him. They’re planning a vacation together with Rocco before her tour begins in September.”</p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong>’s rep exclusively tells <strong>Gossip Cop </strong>that the new tabloid tale is 100 percent “not true,” and that the singer and Penn are not getting back together.</p>
<p>Read more: <a href="http://www.gossipcop.com/madonna-back-together-sean-penn-reunite/" target="_blank"><strong>Gossip Cop </strong></a></p>
