				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Unlike most people who have been in the music business as long as <strong>Madonna</strong><a href="http://www.billboard.com/artist/308786/madonna/chart">,</a> the Material Matron has never written a memoir or even released an officially-sanctioned biography.</p>
<p>Well, that&#8217;s going to change. <strong>Madonna</strong> is promising that one day, <em>Bedtime Stories</em> won&#8217;t be the only kind of tales she&#8217;s shared with her fans.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>I&#8217;m sure I will one day. I&#8217;ve got so many tales to tell,</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p><a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/listen-to-madonna-interview-on-bbc-radio-2/20150331" target="_blank">she told BBC Radio 2</a> when asked if she would write an autobiography. And when she does tackle the project, she won’t half-ass it.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>If I wrote my book that would be from start to finish. And that&#8217;s a whole lot of ground to cover. I think I would tell the stories that I felt were valuable to tell, that were inspiring, that people could relate to. I&#8217;m a storyteller, that&#8217;s what I think of myself as, I would share stories that I think would inspire people.</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p><strong>Madonna</strong> has previously written a number of children&#8217;s books, as well as the insanely controversial (now out-of-print) coffee table book <strong>Sex</strong>.</p>
<p>While we understand a proper autobiography is no easy task, we&#8217;d love to see this happen sooner than later. So to that end, we&#8217;ve taken the liberty of brainstorming potential names for it.</p>
<p><a href="http://www.billboard.com/articles/columns/pop-shop/6517164/madonna-memoir-autobiography-one-day?mobile_redirection=false" target="_blank">Billboard</a> suggested titles for <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s memoir:</p>
<p><em>Bitch, I&#8217;m Madonna</em></p>
<p><em>Live to Tell</em></p>
<p><em>Expressing Myself</em></p>
<p><em>Confessions in a Memoir</em></p>
<p><em>Open Your Heart (And This Book)</em></p>
<p><em>What It Feels Like for a <s>Girl</s> LEGEND</em></p>
<p>Which is your favourite title?</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-promises-shell-write-a-memoir-one-day/20150402">Madonna promises she&#8217;ll write a Memoir &#8216;One Day&#8217;.</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
